      "statement": "Brijio is a pnpm TypeScript monorepo with four owned components: packages/shared (shared protocol and browser-agnostic logic), servers/websocket (relay with auth/presence/routing), servers/mcp (agent-facing tools/resources/prompts/skills), and clients/extensions/chrome plus clients/extensions/safari (browser-side bridge); protocol definitions belong in packages/shared and must not be duplicated.",
